sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Strategy Runtime
    participant R as Branch Risk Gate
    participant F as FPGA Edge
    participant A as Venue Adapter
    participant V as Exchange Simulator
    participant J as Event Journal
    participant P as Portfolio Service
    participant O as Operations

    S->>R: ORDER_INTENT(correlation_id, policy_version, market_sequence)
    R->>R: Validate branch, identity, limits, health, rate
    R->>J: RISK_DECISION(approved or rejected, reason)
    alt Rejected
        R-->>S: RISK_DECISION(REJECTED)
    else Approved
        R->>F: Approved execution token
        F->>F: Verify token and active limit snapshot
        F->>J: ORDER_NEW(submission sequence)
        F->>A: ORDER_NEW(client_order_id)
        A->>V: Venue-native new order
        V-->>A: ACK or REJECT(venue_order_id)
        A-->>F: ORDER_ACK
        F->>J: ORDER_ACK
        V-->>A: FILL(execution_id)
        A-->>P: FILL
        A->>J: FILL
        P->>J: POSITION_UPDATE
    end

    O->>R: HALT(scope, reason)
    R->>F: HALT
    F->>A: CANCEL_ALL
    A->>V: Venue-native cancels
    V-->>A: CANCEL_ACK
    A->>J: HALT and CANCEL evidence
